---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="ManifestKit's privacy policy: what data is collected, what analytics or ads are used, and what happens to the text you type into a tool."
  path="/privacy/"
>
  <article>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="byline">Last updated 2026-09-05</p>

    <h2>The short version</h2>
    <p>
      Every generator on {SITE.name} runs entirely in your browser. Whatever you type into a
      form — a skill description, an MCP server name, rule content — is processed locally with
      plain JavaScript and never sent to a server. Closing the tab discards it; nothing is stored
      unless you click download.
    </p>

    <h2>What this site does collect</h2>
    <p>
      Standard web server logs (IP address, user agent, requested URL) are recorded automatically
      by the hosting provider for security and reliability, the same as almost any website. If
      this site displays advertising (via Google AdSense) or analytics in the future, that
      provider may set cookies and collect data under its own privacy policy — this page will be
      updated to link to it before that happens.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      This site does not set any cookies of its own. Your browser's local storage may be used
      purely to remember your own preferences on a page (nothing account-related); that data
      never leaves your browser.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy: see the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  article {
    max-width: 68ch;
  }
  h2 {
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
  }
  .byline {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
